 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "RateLimiter(limit, ttl). allowRequest(clientId, timestamp) applies the level-1 rule separately for each client: it accepts when fewer than limit accepted requests of that client have timestamps s > timestamp - ttl. Timestamps never decrease across all calls. Every method call is answered in call order on one instance; void methods return nothing.",
